  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). No pair verb. Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{降|ふ}る (X falls [precipitation]).\n\nASPECT: ⟦ている→ている：noentry⟧ indicates ongoing action. {降|ふ}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is raining/snowing.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{雨|あめ}→雨：00583_ame⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{降|ふ}る (rain falls)\n- ⟦{雪|ゆき}→雪：00584_yuki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{降|ふ}る (snow falls)\n- {降|ふ}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (is raining/snowing)\n- {降|ふ}りそう (looks like rain)\n\nOnly for precipitation (rain, snow, hail). Different from ⟦{落|お}ちる→落ちる：01242_ochiru⟧ (objects fall). Weather expression: ⟦{雨|あめ}→雨：00583_ame⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{降|ふ}って⟦います→いる：00495_iru⟧.",
